# LEGO Technic 42114 - Volvo 6x6 Articulated Hauler
# Training data in the 42175 build-language style.
# ADD <name> <partnum> <colour>   - place one part instance
# CONNECT <a.point> -> <b.point> <STIFF|TURNS|LOCKED>  - join two points
# GROUP <name> / END <name>     - bracket a sub-assembly
# ATTACH <sub>.<point> -> <host>.<point> <STIFF|TURNS|LOCKED>
# WHY <one sentence>
# Points are hole/axle indices counted from the part's reference hole.
# ~ means approximate, ? means not shown in the booklet.

